# Tribunal "Investigate Bamz-Amschend": Tienius Delitian, after the attack, wants
# the Dwemer ruins under the Plaza Brindisi Dorom looked into ("investigate the
# disturbance": 15). In Hearthfire Hall the constructs fight the fabricants, and
# coming within 200 of the watcher there logs 50 (fab_cent_fight_watch). Tienius
# takes the report (100).
# Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_mh_attack --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_bamz
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask investigate the disturbance
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Bamz == 15
bye
defend
run
player->PositionCell 3688 3888 13447 0 "Bamz-Amschend, Hearthfire Hall"
until 300 GetPCCell "Bamz-Amschend, Hearthfire Hall" == 1
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_Bamz == 50
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask investigate the disturbance
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Bamz == 100
bye
end
